---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — Betva" description="Read the Betva Terms of Service before registering, paying, posting, or betting." active="" hideNav>
  <div class="page-frame space-y-4">
    <header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
      <a href="/register" class="tap-link text-sm text-[var(--brand)]">Register</a>
    </header>

    <div class="glass p-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-2)] space-y-4 terms-body">
      <p><strong>Version 3</strong> · Last updated: 17 November 2026<br />By creating an account, sending a contribution, posting, or using Betva, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use Betva.</p>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">1. Eligibility &amp; Account Rules</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Age &amp; Law:</strong> You must be 18 years or older and legally permitted under the laws of the United Republic of Tanzania to accept these terms.</li>
          <li><strong>Accurate Details:</strong> You must register using your own registered phone number and the official name tied to that number.</li>
          <li><strong>One Account:</strong> Each person is strictly limited to one account. Accounts cannot be shared, sold, or transferred.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">2. Nature of Service (Virtual Play &amp; Information Only)</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Not a Betting Operator:</strong> Betva is not a bookmaker, gambling operator, or financial institution. Betva does not accept real-money wagers, hold user deposits, or pay out real-money winnings.</li>
          <li><strong>Entertainment Only:</strong> All match markets, virtual stakes, simulated balances, wins, losses, and results on Betva are 100% virtual and provided strictly for entertainment, sports analysis, and simulation purposes.</li>
          <li><strong>External Betting:</strong> Betva provides sports information and tips only. If you choose to place real-money bets with an external, licensed bookmaker, you do so independently and entirely at your own risk.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">3. Official Contributions &amp; Account Activation</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Purpose of Payment:</strong> Any payment sent to Betva is a non-refundable service contribution toward website hosting, internet data, technical maintenance, and tip curation. It is not a gambling stake, deposit, or purchase of guaranteed winning outcomes.</li>
          <li><strong>Single Official Payment Number:</strong> Betva uses only one official payment number: <strong id="terms-number">the number shown on your Profile page</strong>, registered to <strong id="terms-name">the account owner shown on your Profile</strong>. No agent, moderator, or third party is authorized to collect money on Betva’s behalf.</li>
          <li><strong>Fraud &amp; Misdirected Funds:</strong> Never pay a different number sent via chat, SMS, or phone call. If you send money to an unauthorized number, you do so at your own risk. The admin cannot trace, recover, or refund money sent to the wrong recipient.</li>
          <li><strong>Manual Activation &amp; Expiry:</strong> Sending money does not automatically activate your account. After paying, you must contact the admin with valid proof of payment. Access begins only when the admin activates your account and expires automatically on the date shown on your Profile. All service fees are final and non-refundable once access is granted.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">4. No Real-Money Wallet or Payouts</h2>
        <p>Betva does not offer a cash wallet, deposit account, credit facility, or withdrawal system. Any virtual currency, points, or results displayed in the app hold zero monetary value and cannot be exchanged for cash or prizes. Never treat screenshots or messages from other users as proof of real-money earnings.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">5. Virtual Play Rules &amp; Responsible Use</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Match Markets:</strong> Betva displays real sporting fixtures and markets (such as Full Time Over 0.5 Goals and Over 0.5 Half Time) for virtual simulation. Virtual play uses fixed simulated stakes and locks automatically at official kickoff (Africa/Dar_es_Salaam / EAT).</li>
          <li><strong>No Guarantees:</strong> Sports outcomes are unpredictable. Betva makes no guarantees regarding the accuracy of tips, predictions, or match results.</li>
          <li><strong>Self-Pause Feature:</strong> You may voluntarily pause your virtual play access for 3, 6, 12, or 24 hours, or 7 or 30 days. Once activated, a pause is locked and cannot be shortened or cancelled early.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">6. Community Guidelines &amp; User Content</h2>
        <p>You are solely responsible for everything you write, upload, or share in the community section. You strictly agree not to post:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Illegal content, threats, bullying, harassment, hate speech, or abusive language;</li>
          <li>Sexually explicit material, graphic violence, or anything harmful to minors;</li>
          <li>Scams, doctored betting slips, fake payment proofs, impersonation of the admin, or copyright-infringing media;</li>
          <li>Private personal data belonging to others (such as phone numbers, IDs, or addresses);</li>
          <li>Unsolicited ads, spam, or links to external betting sites, payment groups, or third-party channels.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Moderation &amp; Disclaimer:</strong></p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Posts reported by three (3) separate users are hidden automatically pending review.</li>
          <li>The admin reserves the right to remove any content and suspend or permanently ban any account without prior notice or refund if these terms are violated.</li>
          <li>User posts represent the personal views of their authors, not Betva. Betva is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any football club, league, or governing body mentioned on the platform.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">7. Service Availability &amp; Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>As-Is Service:</strong> Betva is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. Temporary downtime, internet disruptions, or third-party data delays may occur without liability to the admin.</li>
          <li><strong>No Liability:</strong> To the fullest extent permitted by Tanzanian law, Betva and its admin shall not be liable for any financial loss, external betting loss, indirect damages, or disputes arising from your use of the platform or reliance on any tips or user posts.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">8. Notifications &amp; Data Privacy</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Official Records:</strong> Your in-app inbox is the official record for system messages and virtual results. Push notifications depend on device and network conditions and are not guaranteed. You may mute or disable notifications in your settings.</li>
          <li><strong>Data We Keep:</strong> We collect and store only the data required to operate Betva and prevent fraud: your phone number, registered name, virtual activity, community posts, and timestamped agreement to these terms. Virtual match results are archived for six (6) months. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">9. Updates to These Terms</h2>
        <p>Betva may update these Terms of Service at any time. When changes are made, the version number at the top will update, and you will be required to review and accept the new version before continuing to use the platform. Your acceptance is logged with the exact date and time.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary w-full">Back to home</a>
  </div>

  <script>
    import { API } from '../lib/api';
    fetch(`${API}/api/v1/config`)
      .then((res) => (res.ok ? res.json() : {}))
      .then((cfg: any) => {
        if (cfg.payment_number) {
          const n = document.getElementById('terms-number');
          if (n) n.textContent = String(cfg.payment_number);
        }
        if (cfg.payment_name) {
          const n = document.getElementById('terms-name');
          if (n) n.textContent = String(cfg.payment_name);
        }
      })
      .catch(() => {});
  </script>
</Layout>
